WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.268 --> 00:00:02.160
♪ Scam ♪

00:00:02.160 --> 00:00:03.080
What's poppin' y'all?

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:04.970
It's Laci Mosley AKA Scam Goddess

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:07.140
and I'm so excited for season two

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:09.780
because we are collaborating
with a very special company,

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:11.620
run by a very special man.

00:00:11.620 --> 00:00:13.053
Wait, where is he?

00:00:14.224 --> 00:00:15.057
(screaming)

00:00:15.057 --> 00:00:16.412
Conan O'Brien!

00:00:16.412 --> 00:00:17.245
Scam Goddess.

00:00:17.245 --> 00:00:18.140
Tune in.

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:18.973
I bow to you.

00:00:18.973 --> 00:00:19.806
Yes!

00:00:19.806 --> 00:00:20.980
Y'all see this?

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.580
All right guys, we'll
see you for season two.

